{{- $c := .Local -}}
{{- $cliName := $c.CliName -}}
Some operations return newline-delimited JSON (JSONL) responses. Each JSON object is streamed to the terminal as it arrives, one per line.

{{- if $c.StreamingJSONL}}

```bash
# Stream JSONL responses
{{$c.StreamingJSONL}} --output-format json

# Apply a jq expression to each item as it arrives ('.' passes it through unchanged)
{{$c.StreamingJSONL}} --output-format json --jq '.'
```
{{- end}}

Use `Ctrl+C` to stop streaming.
